WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:02.090
- If you thought the "Real
Housewives of Beverly Hills"

00:00:02.090 --> 00:00:03.527
was crazy, wait till you see the

00:00:03.527 --> 00:00:06.550
"Real Lawyers of the Real
Housewives of Beverly Hills."

00:00:06.550 --> 00:00:09.500
As you may know, Erika
Girardi, one of the stars

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:10.940
of the Real Housewives of Beverly Hills,

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:13.930
was married to a
once-legendary trial attorney

00:00:13.930 --> 00:00:14.970
named Tom Girardi.

00:00:14.970 --> 00:00:17.130
Tom Girardi created the
well-known plaintiffs' firm

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:18.000
Girardi Keese.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:18.950
But that firm is in bankruptcy,

00:00:18.950 --> 00:00:20.330
in part because of all of the allegations

00:00:20.330 --> 00:00:22.120
of impropriety by Tom Girardi.

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:25.290
Among those include a
potentially $20 million

00:00:25.290 --> 00:00:27.900
that Girardi gave to his then-wife Erika.

00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:32.130
Erika Girardi filed for divorce
in November of last year.

00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:34.550
Erika Girardi's attorney
has tried to withdraw

00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:37.460
from representing her,
but now has backed away

00:00:37.460 --> 00:00:39.500
and is now representing her again.

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:42.800
And a federal judge froze
all Tom Girardi's assets

00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:44.820
because there was evidence
that he stole $2 million

00:00:44.820 --> 00:00:47.250
from spouses and orphans of a plane crash

00:00:47.250 --> 00:00:48.370
that he was representing.

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:51.400
Yes, truth is sometimes
crazier than fiction,

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:54.813
but one thing is for sure, we
will see all of them in court.

